WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.7 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
Monitoring: planned versus actual

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Monitoring compares planned with actual, regularly, so you can act in time.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Track a few indicators, period by period.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Ask why before reacting to any gap.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Share the dashboard with people who can act.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Rejection rate red at 13%: faults traced to one new border design, adjusted before the next order.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your monitoring dashboard and review routine.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
